msgid "Dónde está. Si el disco ha cambiado de letra o has movido la carpeta entera, pon aquí la ruta nueva: los libros se recolocan sin volver a importarlos."
msgstr "Where it is. If the disk has changed letter or you have moved the whole folder, put the new path here: the books are relocated without importing them again."

