msgstr "Paste or type the address of the page you want to read.\n\nIt is fetched, its menus and adverts are removed and it is opened. If it is a PDF or an EPUB, it is downloaded and opened as it is."

msgid "Pega una dirección y el programa trae la página, le quita los menús y los anuncios y la abre para leerla. Evita el rodeo de guardarla con el navegador. La página queda guardada en el disco, así que se puede volver a ella sin conexión."
msgstr "Paste an address and the program fetches the page, removes the menus and the adverts and opens it to be read. It saves the detour of saving it with the browser. The page is kept on the disk, so you can come back to it with no connection."

